				(size 1.8 1.8)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "10a4727d-8c80-4cbe-aa64-4a4296c025d7")
	)
	(text "RX resistors close to PHY; TX source termination belongs on FPGA board.\nStraps: PHY address 1; RX delay 2ns; TX delay 2ns.\nFPGA MAC must not add those delays again. VIO_TARGET = 3.3V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 330.2 190.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "23eb4680-3739-4031-8b54-1c62bfa6184f")
	)
	(text "02  FPGA MAC / RGMII"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 330.2 21.59 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "407af012-97f8-47a5-b1fd-6e90e556db11")
	)
	(text "Crystal loop short; shell pins 2/4 to local ground.\nLoad caps initial: CL = 36p/2 + 2p stray = 20pF.\nReset >=10ms; wait >=50ms after release before MDIO."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 237.49 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "42918784-95a9-4ecd-a5e0-b5ef1280ccef")
	)
	(text "Cable-side PoE taps and shield: J2B on PoE input sheet.\nKeep MDI pairs short, 100 ohm differential; no test-pad stubs."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 101.6 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "4b30b24c-a899-44f5-b801-dc79c4f1750d")
	)
	(text "03  MANAGEMENT / 25 MHz CLOCK"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 129.54 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "5e4c48b9-4b3d-4113-a7e6-78e8cba79d60")
	)
	(text "01  CABLE INTERFACE / MAGNETICS"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 21.59 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "779ca293-1517-4008-bf85-b8080ca354ed")
	)
	(text "Default: orange 100M activity, yellow 1000M activity.\nSet LED1 link10/100 + activity in firmware for 10M indication.\nLeft antiparallel green die unused."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 378.46 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "7c5776ff-c43b-4f14-8aac-e0d0945eaf93")
	)
	(text "Place at PHY-side magnetics exit; route pairs through pads.\nNo ESD connection to primary PoE return."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 342.9 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "b00240a7-9fc2-40fc-a556-e100b463ec3b")
	)
	(text "06  BOOT STRAPS / JACK LEDs"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 209.55 267.97 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "c000297c-ee56-48bb-853d-72a12e7bc33b")
	)
	(text "04  PHY SUPPLIES / INTERNAL 1V CONVERTER"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 330.2 223.52 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "c63e7d04-15d7-4baa-b07b-9d30cd3305a0")
	)
	(text "REG_SW only to L201. Core rail only to this PHY.\nETH_3V3 rise >=0.5ms; VIO starts with/after ETH_3V3.\nReset supervisor and 3.3V ramp on local supplies sheet.\nQFN exposed pad 41: solid ground and thermal vias."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 330.2 382.27 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
